(check in: 12:30 PM)\n___________________________________\n#Rates:\n\n>- **Adult:** (ages 12+) - $125 per person\n>- **Kids:** (ages 2-11)- $99 per person\n>- **Minimum age requirement 2yrs +**\n\n___________________________________\n#Tour Options:\n>- **Turtle Trolley Transportation from Waikiki**\n>- **Complimentary Musubi**", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Kewalo Basin Harbor Pier D, Slip 111: 1125 Ala Moana Blvd B1, Honolulu, HI 96814", "booking_notes": "![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ynloCYbgRLKVDn9jyzsX)\n#ALOHA,\nThank you for booking your **Turtle and You** tour with [And You Creations](https://andyoucreations.com/). \n\nPlease read through this entire email for important general information regarding your tour. Don't hesitate to contact us if you have any questions or special requests.\n\nMahalo!\n\n _________________________\n\nIf you have any questions or concerns, please contact us at 808-696-4414.\nFor emergency inquiries via LINE, search for \"@andyoucreations\" and register with And You Creations.\n\n#WHAT TO BRING:\n• Swimsuit (please arrive ready to jump in the ocean)\n• Beach Towel (oversized preferable)\n• Reef safe Sunscreen, Sunglasses, Hat\n• Long-sleeve Jacket or sweat Shirt (Winter Time)\t\n•  Motion Sickness Medicine (It is most effective to take the pill a little before leaving the hotel.)\n• Adult beverages will be available for purchase on the boat. Hard liquor goes from $6 to $12. Beer and Seltzers are $6.\n•Our meals do not accommodate allergies, We do not prepare the meals so we cannot guarantee anything regarding allergies. For your safety, please prepare your own.\n\n**You will be asked to remove your shoes before boarding the boat. This is for your safety. We will have storage for you to place them in during your time onboard. (Clean reef shoes and grip socks are permitted.)**\n\nPlease limit your belongings to one bag per group due to limited space on the boat.\n\n**Turtle Guarantee: If no turtle is seen, you may rebook for another available date (no refunds). The captain will determine whether a turtle was sighted during your tour. For full details, please contact us at info@andyoucreations.com or (808)696-4414.**\n\nIf you have a US number that we can reach out, please contact us. \n\nSmoking, vaping, alcohol consumption, and the use or possession of illegal drugs are not permitted on our premises, including our buses and boats. Guests who do not comply with this policy may be denied service or removed from the premises at our discretion, without refund.\n\n _________________________\n\nGet ready for a memorable day on the coast of Waikiki!\n\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/hhJNefm8RSeCGUfhBiIA)", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 30, "headline": "30% Off! with CodeTURTLE30 - Waikiki Turtle Snorkeling with a Turtle Guarantee", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/andyoucreations/items/368817/images/725894/", "pk": 725894, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6FcyxAhyRQqxAx6BjZwn", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6FcyxAhyRQqxAx6BjZwn", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/andyoucreations/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/andyoucreations/items/368817/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6FcyxAhyRQqxAx6BjZwn", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6FcyxAhyRQqxAx6BjZwn", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/andyoucreations/items/368817/images/726662/", "pk": 726662, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/jIL1hFgT4qfMBgGu57UR", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackconten